This fork ("@openjev/sdk") rebrands the package for the openjev ecosystem
while remaining wire-compatible with both the hosted TypeSafe API
(https://api.typesafe.ai/v1) and self-hosted openjev deployments, which share
the /v1/systemone contract. The request and response shapes are unchanged.

